WEBVTT

00:00:02.083 --> 00:00:04.625
<c.Caption-C2_1>Ai, Ai, Ai, I love you!

00:00:04.791 --> 00:00:07.291
<c.Caption-C3_1>Mai, Mai, Mai, my darling!

00:00:07.416 --> 00:00:09.958
<c.Caption-C4_1>Mii, Mii, Mii, help me!

00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:14.375
<c.Caption-C5_1>Popotan! Popotan! Popotan!

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.166
<c.Caption-C6_1>Moshimo genki wo nakushite

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:33.916
<c.Caption-C7_1>Tohouni kuretatokiniwa

00:00:34.416 --> 00:00:38.000
<c.Caption-C8_1>Popotan no koe wo kikuno

00:00:39.416 --> 00:00:42.083
<c.Caption-C9_1>Souyo anataga sunaoni

00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:44.500
<c.Caption-C10_1>Natte kokoro wo hirakeba

00:00:45.333 --> 00:00:48.875
<c.Caption-C11_1>Popotan wa oshiete kureru

00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:51.666
<c.Caption-C12_1>Anohito wa kuru? Konai?

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:54.416
<c.Caption-C13_1>Watashi wo suki? Kirai?

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:57.166
<c.Caption-C14_1>Konokoi wa uso? Honto?

00:00:58.083 --> 00:01:02.333
<c.Caption-C15_1>Donna kotomo shitteruno

00:01:03.291 --> 00:01:05.875
<c.Caption-C16_1>Moudame popopo

00:01:05.916 --> 00:01:08.750
<c.Caption-C17_1>Moudame popopo

00:01:09.166 --> 00:01:13.958
<c.Caption-C18_1>Wakatterukedo yamerarenai

00:01:14.041 --> 00:01:16.416
<c.Caption-C19_1>Moumuri popopo

00:01:16.791 --> 00:01:18.833
<c.Caption-C20_1>Moumuri popopo

00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:24.541
<c.Caption-C21_1>Yume no yumedemo akeramenaide

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.875
<c.Caption-C22_1>Popotan!

00:02:24.208 --> 00:02:25.791
<c.Subtitle-C2_1>Amazing!

00:02:25.791 --> 00:02:27.500
<c.Subtitle-C3_1>Amazing! Amazing!

00:02:27.791 --> 00:02:29.833
<c.Subtitle-C4_1>What an amazing toy store!

00:02:30.541 --> 00:02:31.625
<c.Subtitle-C5_1>You're wrong.

00:02:31.625 --> 00:02:34.000
<c.Subtitle-C6_1>This is a Christmas shop.

00:02:36.916 --> 00:02:39.833
<c.Subtitle-C7_1>You have the same ribbon as me!

00:02:39.833 --> 00:02:42.708
<c.Subtitle-C8_1>They sell these everywhere.

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:44.583
<c.Subtitle-C9_1>Oh, come on. You're a toy store.

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:47.083
<c.Subtitle-C10_1>What's with this kid?

00:02:48.333 --> 00:02:49.708
<c.Subtitle-C11_1>This doll.

00:02:50.083 --> 00:02:51.291
<c.Subtitle-C12_1>Can you fix it?

00:02:51.291 --> 00:02:53.291
<c.Subtitle-C13_1>I don't do that sort of thing.

00:02:53.458 --> 00:02:55.041
<c.Subtitle-C14_1>What?!

00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:58.458
<c.Subtitle-C15_1>This is not a toy store and

00:02:55.376 --> 00:02:58.458
<c.Subtitle-C15_2>we don't do toy repairs.

00:02:58.916 --> 00:03:01.333
<c.Subtitle-C16_1>Please! Toy store lady!

00:03:01.875 --> 00:03:02.958
<c.Subtitle-C17_1>Please leave.

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:04.666
<c.Subtitle-C18_1>Come on!

00:03:04.666 --> 00:03:06.833
<c.Subtitle-C19_1>Instead of wasting your time here...

00:03:06.833 --> 00:03:08.875
<c.Subtitle-C20_1>...why don't you go and

00:03:06.834 --> 00:03:08.875
<c.Subtitle-C20_2>play with your friends?

00:03:16.083 --> 00:03:17.625
<c.Subtitle-C21_1>What's the matter?

00:03:17.666 --> 00:03:18.625
<c.Subtitle-C22_1>It's nothing.

00:03:19.625 --> 00:03:21.291
<c.Subtitle-C23_1>Where do you live?

00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:22.375
<c.Subtitle-C24_1>A village.

00:03:22.583 --> 00:03:23.666
<c.Subtitle-C25_1>That way.

00:03:27.625 --> 00:03:30.291
<c.Subtitle-C26_1>Don't you have friends there?

00:03:31.458 --> 00:03:34.166
<c.Subtitle-C27_1>Are you all alone, too?

00:03:51.666 --> 00:03:53.000
<c.Subtitle-C28_1>Why do you say that?

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.833
<c.Subtitle-C29_1>I mean, you're minding

00:03:53.001 --> 00:03:56.833
<c.Subtitle-C29_2>the store all by yourself.

00:03:59.333 --> 00:04:01.416
<c.Subtitle-C30_1>Yes. I suppose.

00:04:04.666 --> 00:04:06.083
<c.Subtitle-C31_1>I'm home!

00:04:08.958 --> 00:04:11.791
<c.Subtitle-C32_1>All that work for nothing.

00:04:11.916 --> 00:04:14.541
<c.Subtitle-C33_1>Tomorrow we'll go to another place

00:04:11.917 --> 00:04:14.541
<c.Subtitle-C33_2>and ask the popotan.

00:04:14.583 --> 00:04:15.375
<c.Subtitle-C34_1>Mea.

00:04:15.375 --> 00:04:17.000
<c.Subtitle-C35_1>How's supper?

00:04:18.375 --> 00:04:19.541
<c.Subtitle-C36_1>Coming up.

00:04:29.083 --> 00:04:30.416
<c.Subtitle-C37_1>She forgot this.

00:04:33.625 --> 00:04:35.375
<c.Subtitle-C38_1>What's with that kid, anyway?

00:04:35.666 --> 00:04:40.666
<c.Caption-C23_1>Alone

00:04:40.666 --> 00:04:43.166
<c.Caption-C24_1>Mii's Place

00:04:40.667 --> 00:04:43.166
<c.Caption-C24_2>Merry Popotan

00:04:41.291 --> 00:04:43.833
<c.Subtitle-C39_1>Puffy, puffy! Not!

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.916
<c.Subtitle-C40_1>Get away from me!

00:04:48.416 --> 00:04:51.041
<c.Subtitle-C41_1>But this one's puffier!

00:04:51.583 --> 00:04:53.291
<c.Subtitle-C42_1>Now, now, Mii.

00:04:56.208 --> 00:04:59.458
<c.Subtitle-C43_1>Why do we all have to bathe

00:04:56.209 --> 00:04:59.458
<c.Subtitle-C43_2>at the same time?

00:04:59.458 --> 00:05:01.291
<c.Subtitle-C44_1>I think it can be fun occasionally.

00:05:01.291 --> 00:05:03.083
<c.Subtitle-C45_1>There's no harm.

00:05:03.125 --> 00:05:05.500
<c.Subtitle-C46_1>I'll leave a change of clothes right here.

00:05:05.541 --> 00:05:06.541
<c.Subtitle-C47_1>Thank you!

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:08.666
<c.Subtitle-C48_1>Anything else?

00:05:08.666 --> 00:05:10.125
<c.Subtitle-C49_1>No. Nothing.

00:05:10.166 --> 00:05:13.041
<c.Subtitle-C50_1>Well, I think I'll retire to my room.

00:05:13.708 --> 00:05:15.916
<c.Subtitle-C51_1>You're going to bed already?

00:05:13.709 --> 00:05:15.916
<c.Subtitle-C51_2>How early.

00:05:16.208 --> 00:05:18.291
<c.Subtitle-C52_1>All right. Thanks for all the work.

00:05:18.708 --> 00:05:20.000
<c.Subtitle-C53_1>Excuse me.

00:05:26.625 --> 00:05:28.541
<c.Subtitle-C54_1>Tomorrow's going to be exhausting, too.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:33.958
<c.Subtitle-C55_1>If only we could ask the locals where

00:05:29.001 --> 00:05:33.958
<c.Subtitle-C55_2>the popotan are, it would be easy.

00:05:33.958 --> 00:05:35.791
<c.Subtitle-C56_1>We have no choice.

00:05:35.791 --> 00:05:38.125
<c.Subtitle-C57_1>We can't do that here.

00:06:16.208 --> 00:06:17.708
<c.Subtitle-C58_1>Wake up, Mii!

00:06:17.708 --> 00:06:20.000
<c.Subtitle-C59_1>It's time to go! Mii!

00:06:22.708 --> 00:06:25.125
<c.Subtitle-C60_1>Another half hour.

00:06:25.666 --> 00:06:26.916
<c.Subtitle-C61_1>No good.

00:06:26.916 --> 00:06:28.458
<c.Subtitle-C62_1>She won't get up.

00:06:28.458 --> 00:06:30.416
<c.Subtitle-C63_1>What'll we do with her?

00:06:30.416 --> 00:06:31.916
<c.Subtitle-C64_1>It's already time.

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:33.416
<c.Subtitle-C65_1>I know!

00:06:34.541 --> 00:06:36.708
<c.Subtitle-C66_1>Unagi, go and wake up Mii.

00:06:39.833 --> 00:06:41.500
<c.Subtitle-C67_1>You're the only one who can do it.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:42.833
<c.Subtitle-C68_1>We're counting on you.

00:06:45.416 --> 00:06:47.416
<c.Subtitle-C69_1>Tell her when she wakes up...

00:06:47.416 --> 00:06:49.041
<c.Subtitle-C70_1>...that we've headed east.

00:06:49.041 --> 00:06:49.875
<c.Subtitle-C71_1>Sure.

00:06:51.083 --> 00:06:52.875
<c.Subtitle-C72_1>Where did you go yesterday?

00:06:53.166 --> 00:06:54.500
<c.Subtitle-C73_1>To the west.

00:06:58.875 --> 00:07:01.333
<c.Subtitle-C74_1>Did you come across a village?

00:07:01.333 --> 00:07:02.875
<c.Subtitle-C75_1>Yes, we did.

00:07:02.875 --> 00:07:05.958
<c.Subtitle-C76_1>About an hour's walking distance.

00:07:09.458 --> 00:07:13.041
<c.Subtitle-C77_1>Unagi, you can do it!

00:07:09.459 --> 00:07:13.041
<c.Subtitle-C77_2>We're counting on you!

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:14.750
<c.Subtitle-C78_1>But...

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:15.750
<c.Subtitle-C79_1>Yes?

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:17.375
<c.Subtitle-C80_1>Why do you ask?

00:07:17.375 --> 00:07:19.125
<c.Subtitle-C81_1>There's really nothing there.

00:07:19.708 --> 00:07:21.125
<c.Subtitle-C82_1>What do you mean?

00:07:21.583 --> 00:07:23.750
<c.Subtitle-C83_1>There is a village there...

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.791
<c.Subtitle-C84_1>...but there's no one living in it.

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:32.500
<c.Subtitle-C85_1>It was abandoned,

00:07:29.501 --> 00:07:32.500
<c.Subtitle-C85_2>and no one lives there.

00:07:33.166 --> 00:07:36.333
<c.Subtitle-C86_1>There are many villages like that.

00:07:36.875 --> 00:07:40.666
<c.Subtitle-C87_1>The young people were not

00:07:36.876 --> 00:07:40.666
<c.Subtitle-C87_2>interested in the rural life...

00:07:40.666 --> 00:07:43.208
<c.Subtitle-C88_1>...and moved to the cities in droves.

00:07:43.583 --> 00:07:46.291
<c.Subtitle-C89_1>The ones left were the old folks.

00:07:46.791 --> 00:07:48.791
<c.Subtitle-C90_1>They got older and older...

00:07:48.791 --> 00:07:52.666
<c.Subtitle-C91_1>...and many went to their

00:07:48.792 --> 00:07:52.666
<c.Subtitle-C91_2>children's places in the cities.

00:07:52.666 --> 00:07:55.875
<c.Subtitle-C92_1>And some simply lived out their lives there.

00:07:56.583 --> 00:07:59.333
<c.Subtitle-C93_1>So, eventually...

00:07:59.333 --> 00:08:03.000
<c.Subtitle-C94_1>...no one was left in the villages.

00:08:15.458 --> 00:08:17.166
<c.Subtitle-C95_1>No one's there.

00:08:17.416 --> 00:08:18.333
<c.Subtitle-C96_1>Yes.

00:08:18.333 --> 00:08:19.791
<c.Subtitle-C97_1>It's sad.

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:24.208
<c.Subtitle-C98_1>I prefer a place like this

00:08:20.251 --> 00:08:24.208
<c.Subtitle-C98_2>much more than the city.

00:08:24.625 --> 00:08:26.875
<c.Subtitle-C99_1>The air is fresh and the scenery is beautiful.

00:08:27.375 --> 00:08:28.500
<c.Subtitle-C100_1>I think so, too.

00:08:29.333 --> 00:08:32.250
<c.Subtitle-C101_1>Right? See? I'm not the only one!

00:08:58.791 --> 00:09:00.125
<c.Subtitle-C102_1>Puffy, puffy.

00:09:01.166 --> 00:09:04.625
<c.Subtitle-C103_1>No! No, you mustn't go there!

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:11.833
<c.Subtitle-C104_1>Come on! That's ticklish!

00:09:12.625 --> 00:09:15.958
<c.Subtitle-C105_1>Unagi! Let me sleep a little bit longer!

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:30.166
<c.Subtitle-C106_1>Thank you.

00:09:31.625 --> 00:09:33.291
<c.Subtitle-C107_1>Shall we go home now?

00:09:34.625 --> 00:09:35.833
<c.Subtitle-C108_1>What's the matter?

00:09:35.833 --> 00:09:38.291
<c.Subtitle-C109_1>Mii played hooky all day!

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:43.916
<c.Subtitle-C110_1>Mii! What time do you think it is?!

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:46.000
<c.Subtitle-C111_1>What'll we do with her?

00:09:47.875 --> 00:09:48.833
<c.Subtitle-C112_1>Mii!

00:09:56.166 --> 00:09:57.166
<c.Subtitle-C113_1>Mai?

00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:00.291
<c.Subtitle-C114_1>She's probably out playing!

00:10:00.333 --> 00:10:02.666
<c.Subtitle-C115_1>I'll find her and give her a cobra twist!

00:10:11.833 --> 00:10:13.000
<c.Subtitle-C116_1>Mii!

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:17.208
<c.Subtitle-C117_1>Mii! Where are you?! Mii!

00:10:23.541 --> 00:10:24.708
<c.Subtitle-C118_1>I'm here.

00:10:25.125 --> 00:10:25.791
<c.Subtitle-C119_1>Mii?

00:10:36.958 --> 00:10:38.791
<c.Subtitle-C120_1>Wh-what is it?

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:47.875
<c.Subtitle-C121_1>Popotan.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.000
<c.Subtitle-C122_1>Popotan.

00:11:01.791 --> 00:11:03.000
<c.Subtitle-C123_1>Lady!

00:11:04.875 --> 00:11:07.416
<c.Subtitle-C124_1>Did you fix my doll?

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:18.000
<c.Subtitle-C125_1>Where did you come from?

00:11:18.583 --> 00:11:19.958
<c.Subtitle-C126_1>The village that way.

00:11:19.958 --> 00:11:22.625
<c.Subtitle-C127_1>No one lives in that village.

00:11:25.208 --> 00:11:27.333
<c.Subtitle-C128_1>I don't like lies.

00:11:27.333 --> 00:11:29.708
<c.Subtitle-C129_1>Where did you really come from?

00:11:31.333 --> 00:11:34.083
<c.Subtitle-C130_1>I was abandoned. Just me.

00:11:34.083 --> 00:11:35.833
<c.Subtitle-C131_1>What do you mean?

00:11:37.166 --> 00:11:39.500
<c.Subtitle-C132_1>But I'm okay now.

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:40.833
<c.Subtitle-C133_1>I'm not alone anymore!

00:11:40.833 --> 00:11:43.416
<c.Subtitle-C134_1>I don't understand.

00:11:40.834 --> 00:11:43.416
<c.Subtitle-C134_2>What do you mean?

00:11:45.958 --> 00:11:48.666
<c.Subtitle-C135_1>You did a nice job fixing her.

00:11:49.125 --> 00:11:50.375
<c.Subtitle-C136_1>Thank you.

00:11:50.375 --> 00:11:50.958
<c.Subtitle-C137_1>Are you...?

00:11:50.958 --> 00:11:51.833
<c.Subtitle-C138_1>Mea!

00:11:50.959 --> 00:11:51.833
<c.Subtitle-C138_2>Are you...?

00:11:51.833 --> 00:11:52.250
<c.Subtitle-C139_1>Mea!

00:11:59.958 --> 00:12:02.375
<c.Subtitle-C140_1>Lady, you're so kind.

00:12:05.333 --> 00:12:06.833
<c.Subtitle-C141_1>Mea!

00:12:14.666 --> 00:12:16.083
<c.Subtitle-C142_1>It's Mai's.

00:12:16.083 --> 00:12:17.583
<c.Subtitle-C143_1>That's all that's here.

00:12:18.125 --> 00:12:19.291
<c.Subtitle-C144_1>Where's Mai?

00:12:19.291 --> 00:12:20.625
<c.Subtitle-C145_1>I don't know.

00:12:20.625 --> 00:12:22.333
<c.Subtitle-C146_1>And Mii's not around, either.

00:12:22.333 --> 00:12:24.166
<c.Subtitle-C147_1>They're not in the house?

00:12:24.166 --> 00:12:25.333
<c.Subtitle-C148_1>No.

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:37.750
<c.Subtitle-C149_1>I don't have a good feeling about this.

00:12:39.375 --> 00:12:41.625
<c.Subtitle-C150_1>If they're not around...

00:13:00.833 --> 00:13:01.875
<c.Subtitle-C151_1>You find them?

00:13:01.875 --> 00:13:02.875
<c.Subtitle-C152_1>No.

00:13:02.875 --> 00:13:04.625
<c.Subtitle-C153_1>Let's go look over there.

00:13:39.583 --> 00:13:40.541
<c.Subtitle-C154_1>Miss Ai?

00:13:42.541 --> 00:13:43.666
<c.Subtitle-C155_1>Miss Ai?

00:13:53.833 --> 00:13:56.125
<c.Subtitle-C156_1>Miss Ai's gone, too?

00:14:16.291 --> 00:14:17.250
<c.Subtitle-C157_1>Y-You're...

00:14:17.541 --> 00:14:19.875
<c.Subtitle-C158_1>Come with me, lady.

00:14:19.875 --> 00:14:22.708
<c.Subtitle-C159_1>You're looking for those three girls, right?

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:29.083
<c.Subtitle-C160_1>Where are we going?

00:14:29.083 --> 00:14:30.250
<c.Subtitle-C161_1>This way.

00:14:33.458 --> 00:14:36.958
<c.Subtitle-C162_1>We'd have a spring festival

00:14:33.459 --> 00:14:36.958
<c.Subtitle-C162_2>every year around this time.

00:14:37.833 --> 00:14:40.958
<c.Subtitle-C163_1>This was a wonderful village, long ago.

00:14:43.708 --> 00:14:46.500
<c.Subtitle-C164_1>It was cheerful and lively.

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:48.416
<c.Subtitle-C165_1>It was so much fun.

00:14:49.041 --> 00:14:50.041
<c.Subtitle-C166_1>But...

00:14:50.166 --> 00:14:51.333
<c.Caption-C25_1>Community Hall

00:14:53.041 --> 00:14:55.125
<c.Subtitle-C167_1>...everyone went away.

00:14:59.416 --> 00:15:01.000
<c.Subtitle-C168_1>Nobody cares.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:03.625
<c.Subtitle-C169_1>Such a fun village.

00:15:07.916 --> 00:15:10.291
<c.Subtitle-C170_1>But they just abandoned it.

00:15:16.666 --> 00:15:18.708
<c.Subtitle-C171_1>Who on earth are you?

00:15:19.625 --> 00:15:20.791
<c.Subtitle-C172_1>Here we are!

00:15:26.541 --> 00:15:27.875
<c.Subtitle-C173_1>This is the place.

00:15:34.166 --> 00:15:37.250
<c.Subtitle-C174_1>Miss Ai? Miss Mai? Miss Mii?

00:15:44.958 --> 00:15:46.458
<c.Subtitle-C175_1>What have you done?

00:16:05.875 --> 00:16:07.000
<c.Subtitle-C176_1>What is this?

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:09.250
<c.Subtitle-C177_1>They're just having dreams.

00:16:11.291 --> 00:16:14.041
<c.Subtitle-C178_1>Dreams that they want to have.

00:16:14.958 --> 00:16:17.500
<c.Subtitle-C179_1>They're all feeling so good right now...

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:19.833
<c.Subtitle-C180_1>...they won't feel like going.

00:16:19.833 --> 00:16:22.083
<c.Subtitle-C181_1>They'll never want to leave.

00:16:26.583 --> 00:16:30.125
<c.Subtitle-C182_1>The people who abandoned

00:16:26.584 --> 00:16:30.125
<c.Subtitle-C182_2>this village were selfish.

00:16:31.083 --> 00:16:32.750
<c.Subtitle-C183_1>But that goes for you, too.

00:16:34.208 --> 00:16:37.625
<c.Subtitle-C184_1>You've kidnapped us and you're

00:16:34.209 --> 00:16:37.625
<c.Subtitle-C184_2>selfishly toying with us.

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:39.875
<c.Subtitle-C185_1>I don't approve of such a thing.

00:16:42.833 --> 00:16:46.083
<c.Subtitle-C186_1>You're not going to join us?

00:16:46.083 --> 00:16:48.583
<c.Subtitle-C187_1>I cannot oblige you.

00:16:51.416 --> 00:16:53.750
<c.Subtitle-C188_1>I thought that you'd join us.

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:01.333
<c.Subtitle-C189_1>Just like the people of the village.

00:17:01.333 --> 00:17:03.041
<c.Subtitle-C190_1>You just don't care...

00:17:03.708 --> 00:17:06.375
<c.Subtitle-C191_1>...about me!

00:17:22.833 --> 00:17:25.291
<c.Subtitle-C192_1>I'm going to make you have a dream, too.

00:17:28.625 --> 00:17:31.541
<c.Subtitle-C193_1>Then you'll want to stay.

00:17:43.083 --> 00:17:44.125
<c.Subtitle-C194_1>How?

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.166
<c.Subtitle-C195_1>How?

00:18:00.791 --> 00:18:02.416
<c.Subtitle-C196_1>How are you able to...?!

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.666
<c.Subtitle-C197_1>No!

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:12.250
<c.Subtitle-C198_1>N-No.

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:17.958
<c.Subtitle-C199_1>No!

00:18:41.625 --> 00:18:43.541
<c.Subtitle-C200_1>I just wanted...

00:18:44.875 --> 00:18:48.208
<c.Subtitle-C201_1>...I just wanted us to be together.

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:52.750
<c.Subtitle-C202_1>I'm all alone again.

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:55.958
<c.Subtitle-C203_1>We are the same as you.

00:19:55.916 --> 00:19:58.416
<c.Subtitle-C204_1>Humans are so selfish.

00:20:16.083 --> 00:20:18.625
<c.Subtitle-C205_1>I feel so tired.

00:20:18.625 --> 00:20:21.291
<c.Subtitle-C206_1>Maybe it was the weird dream I had.

00:20:21.583 --> 00:20:22.750
<c.Subtitle-C207_1>Dream?

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:27.208
<c.Subtitle-C208_1>I wasn't sure if I was scared

00:20:22.751 --> 00:20:27.208
<c.Subtitle-C208_2>or if I was having fun.

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:29.625
<c.Subtitle-C209_1>What? I had a dream like that, too.

00:20:30.333 --> 00:20:33.875
<c.Subtitle-C210_1>I had a dream where both of you were gone.

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:40.166
<c.Subtitle-C211_1>I never want to separate from you, Ai!

00:20:40.166 --> 00:20:42.750
<c.Subtitle-C212_1>It was just a dream. Just a dream.

00:20:43.125 --> 00:20:44.125
<c.Subtitle-C213_1>So?

00:20:44.125 --> 00:20:47.583
<c.Subtitle-C214_1>Was that dream also

00:20:44.126 --> 00:20:47.583
<c.Subtitle-C214_2>kind of scary and kind of fun?

00:20:48.041 --> 00:20:50.583
<c.Subtitle-C215_1>No. There was more to it than that.

00:20:50.958 --> 00:20:53.333
<c.Subtitle-C216_1>But I don't remember it very well.

00:20:53.916 --> 00:20:57.541
<c.Subtitle-C217_1>Like something really sad happened.

00:20:57.541 --> 00:20:59.041
<c.Subtitle-C218_1>That's what it felt like.

00:22:11.875 --> 00:22:15.125
<c.Caption-C26_1>Tekuno panku de aishitetainoyo

00:22:15.125 --> 00:22:18.625
<c.Caption-C27_1>Denpa ni nosete daisuki suki suki

00:22:18.625 --> 00:22:22.125
<c.Caption-C28_1>Romanchikku wo anatani agetai

00:22:22.125 --> 00:22:23.750
<c.Caption-C29_1>Waratte hoshii

00:22:23.750 --> 00:22:25.541
<c.Caption-C30_1>I love, love, love you

00:22:25.541 --> 00:22:28.833
<c.Caption-C31_1>S.U.K.I. dokidoki love

00:22:28.833 --> 00:22:32.333
<c.Caption-C32_1>S.U.K.I. gimigimi kiss

00:22:32.333 --> 00:22:35.875
<c.Caption-C33_1>S.U.K.I. sukisuki love

00:22:35.875 --> 00:22:39.500
<c.Caption-C34_1>S.U.K.I. sukiari kiss

00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:41.208
<c.Caption-C35_1>Mawaru mawaru

00:22:41.208 --> 00:22:43.125
<c.Caption-C36_1>Jikuu no hariga

00:22:43.125 --> 00:22:46.583
<c.Caption-C37_1>Kimi to boku no zahyou wo sasuno

00:22:46.583 --> 00:22:49.750
<c.Caption-C38_1>Toketeikuwa ai no himitsu

00:22:49.750 --> 00:22:54.125
<c.Caption-C39_1>Dokidoki surukoto madamada shiritaiwa

00:22:56.708 --> 00:23:03.416
<c.Caption-C40_1>Every boy, every girl kiseki wo

00:22:56.709 --> 00:23:03.416
<c.Caption-C40_2>shinjitara mirakuru kurukuru

00:23:03.875 --> 00:23:10.375
<c.Caption-C41_1>Kitto mitsukaruwa beriberi

00:23:03.876 --> 00:23:10.375
<c.Caption-C41_2>surotoberi dei beriberi beriberi

00:23:10.708 --> 00:23:16.750
<c.Caption-C42_1>Itsuka sayonara ga

00:23:10.709 --> 00:23:16.750
<c.Caption-C42_2>yattekitatte daijoubunakurai

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:21.541
<c.Caption-C43_1>Motto anatani sukisuki daisuki tsutaetai

00:23:21.541 --> 00:23:24.625
<c.Caption-C44_1>I love you! I, I love you!

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:30.166
<c.Subtitle-C219_1>Transform! Una!

00:23:40.916 --> 00:23:44.708
<c.Subtitle-C220_1>Well, was I cute in that episode?

00:23:46.041 --> 00:24:03.208
<c.Caption-C45_1>Hot Springs

00:23:46.833 --> 00:23:49.833
<c.Subtitle-C221_1>Okay, the next episode of

00:23:46.834 --> 00:23:49.833
<c.Subtitle-C221_2>Popotan is "Hot Springs".

00:23:49.833 --> 00:23:52.458
<c.Subtitle-C222_1>So we finally made it

00:23:49.834 --> 00:23:52.458
<c.Subtitle-C222_2>to the hot springs!

00:23:52.458 --> 00:23:56.250
<c.Subtitle-C223_1>And I don't want to hear anything

00:23:52.459 --> 00:23:56.250
<c.Subtitle-C223_2>about us always being in the bath.

00:23:56.250 --> 00:23:58.375
<c.Subtitle-C224_1>And it isn't only about hot springs.

00:23:58.375 --> 00:24:00.416
<c.Subtitle-C225_1>We're in bathing suits

00:23:58.376 --> 00:24:00.416
<c.Subtitle-C225_2>and all these misunderstandings.

00:24:00.416 --> 00:24:03.208
<c.Subtitle-C226_1>What?! There's that, too?!

00:24:07.291 --> 00:24:09.583
<c.Subtitle-C227_1>Good night, everyone!
